    "protoGuide": {"x": 1520, "y": 0, "w": 420, "maxH": 640, "page": "proto", "fill": "teal", "text": "Press Play on the prototype, then try:\n\n1. Play / pause the drop loop.\n2. Click the acid block in the drop: the 303 opens in the dock. Pop it out, drag it, dock it back.\n3. Click the suggestion \"open the filter in the build\" and watch it happen in normal mode.\n4. Turn on Learning mode and ask again: step through with Back / Next, try Let me try.\n5. Open the browser and drag Ride onto the timeline (or press Add).\n6. Open Approvals and approve the pending rearrangement.\n7. Click the loudness readout to open the listening view."}
